  "case": "cost-usd-small-pins-decimal-rounding",
  "description": "Pins round half up against round half to even on a small amount: 0.0010000005 has a 5 in the tenth place and rounds up to 1000001 nano-USD. It does not separate the decimal rule from a float product: 0.0010000005 times 10^9 is exactly 1000000.5, which rounds to the same integer when halves go away from zero. cost-usd-small-separates-float-product does.",
